  },
  {
    "id": "abb4a758-b636-5b7c-88d6-3498434e576b",
    "pack": "bestiary-2",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:ravener-soul-ward",
    "name": "(Ravener) Soul Ward",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bestiary-2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "An intangible field of necromantic energy protects a ravener from total destruction. A soul ward has 150 maximum Hit Points, or 200 if the ravener is level 21 or higher."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whenever a ravener would be reduced below 1 Hit Point, all damage in excess of what would reduce them to 1 Hit Point is instead dealt to their soul ward. If this damage reduces the soul ward to fewer than 0 Hit Points, the ravener is destroyed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A soul ward's Hit Points can be restored only via specific ravener abilities such as Consume Soul, ravenous breath, or vicious criticals. A ravener who goes more than a week without successfully using Consume Soul to feed on a dying creature starves, and their soul ward loses {1d4} Hit Points each day until they feed. If the ravener's soul ward loses all its Hit Points while the ravener still has more than 1 HP, they become a Ravener Husk."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.FsqVhavMWAoFro1L"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "defensive"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "fa6912fd-3517-5919-91ce-a30360687970",
    "pack": "bestiary-2",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:ravener-soulsense",
    "name": "(Ravener) Soulsense",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bestiary-2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A ravener senses the spiritual essence of living and undead creatures within the listed range. Creatures whose material bodies are one unit with their souls, like celestials and fiends, appear brighter to this sense."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.fYDrunTldWmFvfjl"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "interaction"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "c9602255-e7e5-59a6-afc9-87372c0db869",
    "pack": "bestiary-2",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:ravener-vicious-criticals",
    "name": "(Ravener) Vicious Criticals",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bestiary-2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The ravener treats an attack roll as a critical hit on a roll of 19 or 20, as long as the attack roll was a success. Additionally, whenever the ravener makes a critical hit with one of their Strikes, the target must succeed on a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save or gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition. If the target already has a drained value of greater than 0, their drained value instead increases by 1, to a maximum of drained 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whenever the ravener applies drain to a creature in this way, their soul ward gains 5 Hit Points."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "AdjustDegreeOfSuccess",
        "selectors": ["attack-roll"],
        "adjustment": {
          "success": "to-critical-success"
        },
        "predicate": ["check:roll:total:natural:19"]
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.XbHMVjHtbPaPr9P5"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "offensive"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "dd49531c-7a1e-5ae5-9b1a-1b89f8723067",
    "pack": "bestiary-2",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:vampire-vrykolakas-drink-blood",
    "name": "(Vampire, Vrykolakas) Drink Blood",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["divine"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bestiary-2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The vrykolakas' last action was a successful fangs Strike"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The vrykolakas sinks its fangs into that creature to drink its blood. This requires an "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:athletics"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check against the creature's Fortitude DC. On a success, the creature becomes "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " ("
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " if a vrykolakas master uses this action), and the vrykolakas regains HP equal to 10% of its maximum HP, gaining any excess HP as temporary Hit Points. Drinking Blood from a creature that's already drained doesn't restore any HP to the vampire, but it increases the creature's drained condition value by 1. A vrykolakas can also consume blood that's been emptied into a vessel for sustenance, but it gains no HP from doing so."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The target creature's drained condition value decreases by 1 per week. A blood transfusion, which requires a successful "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:medicine",
            "dc": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check and sufficient blood or a blood donor, reduces the drained value by 1 after 10 minutes."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.98twzz56mMGN5Ftw"
    },
    "data": {
      "cost": "one",
      "category": "offensive",
      "requirementsText": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The vrykolakas' last action was a successful fangs Strike"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "22ec56a8-fc59-5646-b15c-57063898ef90",
    "pack": "bestiary-2",
    "kind": "action",
    "slug": "action:vampire-vrykolakas-feral-possession",
    "name": "(Vampire, Vrykolakas) Feral Possession",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["curse", "divine", "incapacitation", "mental", "possession"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bestiary-2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The vrykolakas is reduced to 0 Hit Points, and an animal is within 100 feet"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Unlike most other undead, a vrykolakas isn't destroyed when it reaches 0 HP. Instead, it attempts to cast its spirit into an animal within 100 feet, which must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save (use a high DC for the vrykolakas's level)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "On a failure, the animal is possessed. This has the effects of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "dc3bb06e-92bb-5b57-8b64-bc76e3d979ce"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " spell, but it lasts a number of days equal to the vrykolakas's level. This possession can't be counteracted with magic (though "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9495e90b-a69c-5eaf-a472-b6b536856f28"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " works against it normally)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If the animal succeeds at its save, the vrykolakas can attempt to possess a different animal within 100 feet. If at any point an animal critically succeeds at its save or no animal is within 100 feet, the vrykolakas fails to possess anything and is destroyed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A vrykolakas possessing an animal seeks out its burial site immediately, burying itself there. While the vrykolakas is in this state of recovery, its animal host is "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "7802f1d9-5ced-5b9b-8a08-98ec0adb9947"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and beheading it destroys the vrykolakas and kills its host. Removing the curse destroys the vrykolakas and returns the animal to normal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "After 1d4 days, if the vrykolakas hasn't been destroyed, the animal dies and the vrykolakas rises in a new body that's identical to its previous one, formed from the animal's remains."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
